 Managing Kubernetes with Ansible
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Ansible on a Linux machine
Set up a local Kubernetes cluster using Minikube
Create Ansible playbooks to manage Kubernetes resources
Automate the creation and management of Kubernetes deployments using Ansible
Scale deployments and manage services through Ansible automation
Understand the integration between Ansible and Kubernetes for infrastructure automation
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with YAML syntax
Basic knowledge of containerization concepts
Understanding of Kubernetes fundamentals (pods, deployments, services)
Basic knowledge of Ansible concepts (playbooks, tasks, modules)
