Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Ansible kubernetes.core collection not found

# Solution: Reinstall the collection
ansible-galaxy collection install kubernetes.core --force
Issue 2: Permission denied when accessing Docker

# Solution: Add user to docker group and restart session
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER
newgrp docker
Issue 3: Minikube fails to start

# Solution: Check Docker status and restart if needed
sudo systemctl status docker
sudo systemctl restart docker
minikube delete
minikube start --driver=docker
Issue 4: kubectl connection refused

# Solution: Ensure Minikube is running and context is set
minikube status
kubectl config current-context
minikube update-context
Issue 5: Python dependencies missing

# Solution: Install required Python packages
pip3 install kubernetes pyyaml requests
